{"label":"Distance, speed and time","slots":{"distance":"km","speed":"km/h","time":"h"},"rules":[{"id":"travel.distance","output":"distance","inputs":["speed","time"],"expr":{"op":"*","args":[{"ref":"speed"},{"ref":"time"}]},"formula":"speed × time","cost":1,"weight":1},{"id":"travel.speed","output":"speed","inputs":["distance","time"],"expr":{"op":"/","args":[{"ref":"distance"},{"ref":"time"}]},"formula":"distance ÷ time","cost":1,"weight":1},{"id":"travel.time","output":"time","inputs":["distance","speed"],"expr":{"op":"/","args":[{"ref":"distance"},{"ref":"speed"}]},"formula":"distance ÷ speed","cost":1,"weight":1}],"assumptions":["Speed is constant or is the average for the whole journey; stops are not included unless reflected in that average."]}